<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal construction activity to rise - INE.</title>
<headline>Portugal construction activity to rise - INE.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction activity in Portugal will continue to rise in the near future, boosted by public works, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said in an industry report for November.</p>
<p>&quot;Prices are unlikely to rise, however, the increase (in activity) over the past few months will continue largely as a result of developments in public works,&quot; INE said.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
